{# The global deadlines agenda: what has to be done today, across every case.

   The page is server rendered from `view`, which already carries every row with the
   buttons resolved for it, so nothing here decides anything legal. The selection the
   page was built under travels in the query string, so a filtered agenda survives a
   refresh and can be handed to a colleague as a link.

   Zones, top to bottom: heading, risk bar, blocked cases (collapsed), the agenda
   grouped by time bucket, and a rail with the limitation periods falling beyond the
   window. The note about email alerts sits under the agenda, where it is read once,
   instead of competing with the rail every day.

   The two ids below are the targets an action fired from a row replaces, so the page
   updates in place instead of throwing the lawyer into the case the deadline belongs
   to. The dialogs sit outside both regions but under the same controller, so acting
   never destroys the dialog that asked the question.

   @var view         App\Service\Deadline\DeadlinePageView
   @var add_cases    list<App\Entity\LegalCase> choices of the add dialog
   @var add_modal_id string #}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}{{ 'deadlines.title'|trans }} - {{ parent() }}{% endblock %}

{% block breadcrumb %}
    <li class="font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">{{ 'deadlines.heading'|trans }}</li>
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
{% from 'deadlines/_icons.html.twig' import plus %}

<div class="space-y-5"
     data-controller="agenda-dialog"
     data-agenda-dialog-confirm-modal-id-value="hs-modal-agenda-confirm-close">

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-3">
        <div>
            <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">{{ 'deadlines.heading'|trans }}</h1>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">{{ 'deadlines.window'|trans({ '%date%': view.windowEnd|date('d.m.Y') }) }}</p>
        </div>

        {# Offered only when there is a case to attach a reminder to: an empty select
           would promise something the account cannot do yet. #}
        {% if add_cases|length > 0 %}
            <button type="button"
                    class="self-start inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition"
                    data-agenda-action="add-deadline"
                    data-hs-overlay="#{{ add_modal_id }}">
                {{ plus('size-4 text-slate-400') }}
                {{ 'deadlines.add.open'|trans }}
            </button>
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div id="deadline-riskbar">{{ include('deadlines/_riskbar_region.html.twig', { view: view }, with_context = false) }}</div>

    <div id="deadline-agenda" class="space-y-5">{{ include('deadlines/_agenda_region.html.twig', { view: view }, with_context = false) }}</div>

    {{ include('deadlines/_dialogs.html.twig', {
        view: view,
        add_cases: add_cases,
        add_modal_id: add_modal_id,
    }, with_context = false) }}
</div>
{% endblock %}
